    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***4TH FLOOR APARTMENT / APPROX. 79SQ.M. / TWO LARGE DOUBLE BEDROOMS / BALCONY ACCESS / EXCELLENT CITY VIEWS / 24-HOUR CONCIERGE / COMMUNAL ROOFTOP TERRACE***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are delighted to present Apartment 17, Block E, Smithfield Market, Smithfield, Dublin 7, to the market.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the fourth floor of this highly regarded city-centre development, Apartment 17 is a spacious and exceptionally bright two-bedroom apartment extending to approximately 79sq.m. The property further benefits from excellent storage, balcony access from both bedrooms and impressive city views.\r\n\r\nBlock E1 enjoys a particularly private setting, with just four apartments per floor and only 21 apartments in the block, adding to the sense of exclusivity within this landmark Smithfield development.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the apartment, you are welcomed by a generous entrance hallway with an excellent walk-in storage room, providing valuable additional space rarely found in city-centre apartments.\r\n\r\nThere are two large double bedrooms, both enjoying direct access to the balcony and excellent natural light. Each bedroom benefits from built-in wardrobes, while the master bedroom is further enhanced by a superb walk-through wardrobe, offering excellent storage and adding a real sense of space to the room.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is the bright and spacious living and dining area. Two large windows flood the room with natural light while framing impressive views across the city towards Liberty Hall, creating a wonderful backdrop to this generous living space.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is well positioned adjoining the living and dining area and benefits from an additional storage cupboard, further enhancing the practicality of the apartment.\r\n\r\nThe balcony provides valuable private outdoor space and can be accessed directly from both bedrooms, creating a wonderful extension of the accommodation and an ideal spot to enjoy the city surroundings.\r\n\r\nResidents of Smithfield Market also benefit from a 24-hour concierge service and access to an impressive large communal rooftop terrace, which enjoys spectacular 360-degree views across Dublin City.\r\n\r\nSmithfield Market is a vibrant mixed-use development combining residential, commercial, retail, hotel, leisure and cultural amenities within a superb city-centre setting. The surrounding area offers an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, shops and leisure facilities, with the Four Courts, King's Inns, Old Jameson Distillery, St. Michan's Church, Lighthouse Cinema and Phoenix Park all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nTransport links are excellent, with the Smithfield LUAS stop just moments away and numerous Dublin Bus routes serving the surrounding area, providing convenient access throughout Dublin City.\r\n\r\nApartment 17 offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a particularly spacious and light-filled two-bedroom apartment, superb storage, private outdoor space and outstanding communal facilities in the heart of Dublin 7."
      },
